    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smashing in Smithfield!\n\nApt. 55, Smithfield Market is a lovely two bedroom, fifth floor apartment with parking. This superb corner property boasts a wrap-around balcony and offers enchanting views over Smithfield Square and beyond. \n\nThe property benefits from an exceptionally convenient location, within easy walking distance of TUD Grangegorman, NCAD, Blackhall Place, the city centre and the Four Courts.\n\nAn excellent variety of shopping options is on offer nearby on Capel Street, Jervis Street, and Henry Street. Smithfield Village itself presents a great selection of cafés and restaurants, whilst the LUAS line is right on the doorstep providing easy and highly convenient access to all areas of the city. Other nearby landmarks include Trinity College, Grafton Street, St. Stephen`s Green, Stoneybatter, the Jameson Distillery, the fantastic Lighthouse cinema and the Phoenix Park, all but a short stroll away.\n\nAccommodation comprises entrance hallway, generous open plan sittingroom with fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms, one ensuite and a main bathroom. This bright and spacious corner apartment is vacant and ready to go.\n\nContact Michael in Young`s Estate Agents to arrange your viewing.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 5th floor two bedroom corner apartment </li><li> Designated parking space </li><li> Lift access </li><li> Wrap-around balcony </li><li> Main bedroom ensuite </li><li> Ten minute walk to city centre </li><li> Mgmt fee 4700 p.a approx. </li><li> 24hr concierge service </li><li> Communal rooftop garden/Modern electric heating </li><li> 904 sq.ft / 84 sq.m approx.</li></ul>"
      },
